# Route: guide 28 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Dwarf (1451
# of 1458 eligible quests, 164.1 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 46 to 48, 33
# quests, 3.0 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Feralas): Sardor Isle -> The Twin Colossals -> Feral Scar Vale -> The
# Forgotten Coast -> The Twin Colossals -> Sardor Isle -> Isle of Dread ->
# Sardor Isle -> The Twin Colossals -> Grimtotem Compound -> Feral Scar Vale
# -> Ruins of Isildien -> The Writhing Deep -> ….
#
# Profession quests here are not routed (they need the skill): 2847 Wild
# Leather Armor; 2848 Wild Leather Shoulders; 2849 Wild Leather Vest; 2850
# Wild Leather Helmet; 2851 Wild Leather Boots; 2852 Wild Leather Leggings;
# 2853 Master of the Wild Leather.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): The Crone of the Kraul (1101), Pusillin and the Elder
# Azj'Tordin (7441), Elven Legends (7482), Lethtendris's Web (7488).

